      "updated": 1755300000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aggregates reviews + routes into IMDF-shaped GeoJSON:\nUnit (walkway/room), Opening (accessible: true/false),\nAmenity (elevator, accessible restroom).\nSelf-hosted \u2014 NOT submitted to Apple, no review needed.\nRegenerates whenever venue_imdf_archives.is_stale is set.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
